  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nMG1TNv.png\" alt=\"關於\"></p>\n<p>想在使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animation</a> 的同時體驗 Ashen？厭倦了該模組的紋理與 Ashen 的食物紋理不搭調，每次進食時都顯得格外突兀嗎？那麼這個附加資源包正是為你量身打造的！</p>\n<p>首先，請確保 Eating Animation 的內建資源包在載入順序中位於 Ashen <em>下方</em>。接著，將此資源包放在 Ashen <em>上方</em>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>此資源包專為搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-16x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ashen 16x</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animation</a> 而設計。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faim-boot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3c357293-8dfb-410a-a5e3-0d778833e154.webp\" alt=\"Bisect 橫幅\"></a></p>",
